# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REAL FINANCIAL DOCUMENTS — NEVER COMMIT
# These contain full legal name, account number, and an unmasked
# card number on every debit-card row. See docs/DECISIONS.md D-007.
# Golden fixtures go in Tests/Fixtures/ and MUST be redacted first.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
statements_suhaas/
*Statement.pdf
*statement*.pdf
transaction_history*.pdf
*.eStatement.pdf

# Extracted intermediates — these contain the same PII as the source
*.extracted.txt
*.extracted.json
scratch/

# Screenshots of statements — same PII as the PDFs.
IMG_*.PNG
IMG_*.png
**/statement*screenshot*

# Third-party UI reference kits and recordings. Kept locally, not
# redistributed — docs/inspiration/README.md is self-sufficient without them.
# Screen recordings are excluded on principle: they capture whatever else
# was on screen.
docs/inspiration/*.png
docs/inspiration/*.jpg
docs/inspiration/*.jpeg
docs/inspiration/*.gif
docs/inspiration/*.mov
docs/inspiration/*.mp4
*.mov
*.mp4

# Local agent build rules — kept out of the public repo by choice.
# docs/HANDOFF.md §4 carries the same non-negotiables and is self-sufficient.
CLAUDE.md

